{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25805","headline":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 早梅桥 · 李绅","name":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 早梅桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早梅花，满枝发。\n东风报春春未彻，紫萼迎风玉珠裂。\n杨柳未黄莺结舌，委素飘香照新月。\n桥边一树伤离别，游荡行人莫攀折。\n不竞江南艳阳节，任落东风伴春雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}